tion-topic source-map rows; 29 identities outside the admitted structural authority remain excluded.\n- Produced one active registry, one shared procedure library, one compact maker delta, and an immutable #1719 semantic KG release. The #1714 structural release remains byte-identical.\n- Projected status-qualified Topic, QuestionFamily, QuestionType, ProcedureModel, and ordered ProcedureStep nodes/edges into the existing KG v0 contract.\n- Extended the authenticated route with default approved-only reads and explicit `candidate_preview`; candidates never appear as approved truth.\n- Preserved the historical #1716 script and proof bytes unchanged and passing.\n- Addressed both exact-head review rounds: implicit by-parts and supplied partial-fraction recognition, LaTeX derivative recognition, mixed symbolic/numeric preservation, pure numerical-only rejection, immutable release ownership, legacy fail-closed compatibility, question-bound evidence validation, exact classification-target validation, and candidate-aware coverage.\n- Marked `semantic-review-delta.json` explicitly as a deterministic maker delta with release admission pending external SHA-bound AO review; it no longer self-asserts independent approval.\n\n## Production metrics\n\n- discovered_family_question_count: 296\n- candidate_question_count: 93\n- approved_question_count: 170\n- abstain_question_count: 12\n- rejected_question_count: 21\n- approved_question_type_count: 5\n- procedure_model_count: 5\n- questions_per_procedure_model: by-parts 19; direct/reverse-chain 71; partial-fractions 21; substitution 15; trigonometric 44\n- singleton_candidate_count: 0\n- procedure_reuse_ratio: 34.0\n- candidate_exposed_as_approved_count: 0\n- product_readback_pass_rate: 100% (170/170 approved mappings; 93/93 candidates omitted from approved-only reads)\n- unclassified_question_count: 3234 (approved and candidate mappings both counted as classified)\n\n## Gates and tests\n\n- deterministic rebuild and byte check: PASS\n- exact question-bound QP/MS evidence readback: PASS\n- exact primary/secondary classification-target validation: PASS\n- structural_authority_write_count: 0\n- duplicate_active_identity_count: 0\n- dangling_edge_count: 0\n- unsupported_inferred_edge_count: 0\n- stale_authority_reference_count: 0\n- provider_call_count / remote_write_count: 0 / 0\n- semantic Python tests: 13/13\n- predecessor structural Python tests: 15/15 plus byte-identical #1714 rebuild\n- legacy #1716 checked-in readback: byte-identical PASS\n- deterministic #1719 authenticated readback script: PASS\n- focused authenticated API/route tests: 55/55\n- targeted ESLint, report-artifact index, py_compile, and diff hygiene: PASS\n- A+ ratchet: warning-mode only for the already-large readback repository; no blocking regression and no exception added\n\n## Scope\n\n12 changed files and exactly 6 new active artifacts; within the Issue defaults. The authenticated readback remains deterministic script/test and PR evidence rather than a seventh checked-in artifact. No provider calls, screenshots, structural re-extraction, remote data writes, new governance framework, child Issue, or merge action.","created_at":"2026-07-27T10:00:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T12:31:05Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T12:31:05Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T12:31:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"6df02c5a5ee5ba710d8692939d0994a1f3a4e1d0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1720/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1720/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1720/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/25a09b6794dc00db44e105b2b17ba77bb4fc3c48","head":{"